  "finding": "With six colorless mana and Prismite, Concentrate can be paid by activating the same filter twice. Ordered native witnesses resolve it; automatic payment refuses it in original/one/two-copy games on the selected runtime. Four colorless plus one Island is an independent passing boundary; five colorless without blue is refused without mutation.",
