  "fixture_corrections": [
    "v13 incorrectly used a nonexistent ManaPool.stream API; compilation failed before any native test. v14 uses Iterable iteration.",
    "v14 compared the card color mask zero to a mana color atom; v15 uses Mana.isColorless(). Native output guard still correctly failed because the replacement was not active.",
    "The ProduceMana replacement defaults to a tapping activation. v16 attempts an explicit selector, but ManaAbility is a property, not a standalone inclusive ability type. v17 uses Activated.ManaAbility. Native output then demonstrably becomes C and all three refusal/purity controls pass."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "This is an unregistered, uninstalled source prototype. The installed3142-case runtime remains selected and still has the reproduced repeated-filter gap.",
    "Explicit per-turn/per-game activation limits and static additional-activation restrictions require controls before registration or activation; supplied unrestricted Prismite cases do not prove bounded reusability.",
    "Chained filters, colored activation costs, variable-X waterbend, activation-cost modifiers and user-facing assessment diagnostics remain unfinished.",
    "Fresh registered native, packaged, broader, full integration, catalog, byte and health gates are still required before installation. All prior budgets and cases were retained.",
    "Some inherited raw driver scope strings describe earlier33-case fixtures. The saved method results, frozen inputs and finalized48-case fixture determine this validation scope. Synthetic replacement controls are native contracts, not claims about a printed MTG card.",
    "Source/catalog construction and supplied tests do not establish complete card/rules/AI support."
  ],
